<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90194" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προστροπ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turning</i> of a suppliant (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱκέτης</span>) <i>to</i> a god or man to
			implore protection or purification, <i>supplication</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				718
			</span></i> (pl.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιταὶ καὶ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.560e
			</span></i>: hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>any address to a god, solemn invocation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοὺς . . προστροπαῖς ἱκνουμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					216
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				1156
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1).26.10
			</span></i> (Amyclae, <span class="entity">ii/i B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱκεσία ξένων π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				108
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ ἀρὰν ὑπὲρ τούτων ἐποιήσαντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.110
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεᾶς ἔχω προστροπήν</span>
			discharge <i>the duty of ministering</i> to the goddess, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				618
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεως προστροπὴν
			ἔχειν</span> address a <i>petition</i> to the city, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				558
			</span></i>; of libations, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				85
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. γυναικῶν</span>
			<i>suppliant band</i> of women, ib. <i><span class="en">
				21
			</span></i>.</div>
